### Create Meal
POST http://localhost:8080/api/meals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mealDate": "2026-09-28",
  "mealType": "BREAKFAST",
  "description": "Idli and Sambar",
  "menuItem": {
    "id": 1
  }
}
### Get All Meals
GET http://localhost:8080/api/meals
### Get Meals By Date
GET http://localhost:8080/api/meals/date/2026-09-28
### Get Meals By Type
GET http://localhost:8080/api/meals/type/BREAKFAST
