### MEAL OPT-OUT
### ==========================================

### Create Meal Opt-Out
POST http://localhost:8080/api/meal-opt-outs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resident": {
    "id": 1
  },
  "optOutDate": "2026-09-29"
}
### Get All Meal Opt-Outs
GET http://localhost:8080/api/meal-opt-outs
### Get Meal Opt-Out by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/meal-opt-outs/1
### Get Opt-Outs by Resident
GET http://localhost:8080/api/meal-opt-outs/resident/1
### Update Meal Opt-Out
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/meal-opt-outs/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "optOutDate": "2026-09-30"
}
### Delete Meal Opt-Out
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/meal-opt-outs/1
### Verify Meal Opt-Out Deletion
GET http://localhost:8080/api/meal-opt-outs
### ==========================================
### FEEDBACK
### ==========================================

### Create Feedback
POST http://localhost:8080/api/feedback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resident": {
    "id": 1
  },
  "meal": {
    "id": 1
  },
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "The meal was very good."
}
### Check Existing Meals
GET http://localhost:8080/api/meals
### Check Menu Items
GET http://localhost:8080/api/menu-items
